      No Xbox-specific "extension SDK" is referenced here. Verified against Microsoft's own
      current WebView2-on-Xbox reference sample (microsoft/Media-App-Samples-for-Xbox,
      WebView2/cs/JavaScriptVideoSample) - it has zero SDKReference entries. UWP's documented
      extension SDK list (Windows Desktop/Mobile/Team Extensions) has no Xbox entry at all;
      Xbox targeting is expressed purely via Package.appxmanifest's TargetDeviceFamily, not a
      csproj SDK reference. If a future phase needs Xbox-only WinRT APIs, re-check this - but
      for this WebView2 shell, nothing beyond the packages below is required.
    -->
